;s election and intensified the confrontation with the Medellín cartel.</p><p><span class="pill death-grade">Baseline dossier published; continuing evidence review</span></p><div class="death-facts"><span>18 Aug 1989</span><span>Soacha, Colombia</span><span>Homicide and political assassination</span></div><div class="cta-row small"><a class="btn" href="death-file-luis-carlos-galan.html">Open dossier</a><a class="btn alt" href="death-file-luis-carlos-galan.html#signal-drop">Signal Drop</a></div></article><article class="card death-card" data-death-card="alfred-herrhausen"><span class="label">1989 · Banker · Bombing</span><h3>Alfred Herrhausen</h3><p>Herrhausen was a leading banker advocating debt relief and new approaches to Eastern Europe during the end of the Cold War. His death removed an influential banker during a decisive transformation of Europe and global debt policy.</p><p><span class="pill death-grade">Baseline dossier published; continuing evidence review</span></p><div class="death-facts"><span>30 Nov 1989</span><span>Bad Homburg, West Germany</span><span>Homicide</span></div><div class="cta-row small"><a class="btn" href="death-file-alfred-herrhausen.html">Open dossier</a><a class="btn alt" href="death-file-alfred-herrhausen.html#signal-drop">Signal Drop</a></div></article></div></section><section class="section wrap"><h2>Year Pattern Boundary</h2><article class="card"><p>Shared dates, institutions, investigators, lawyers, beneficiaries, or security failures are leads for comparison. A pattern does not establish coordination.</p></article></section><script type="application/json" id="compatibility-marker-vault" data-cleanup-marker="deep-cleanup">{"status":"compatibility-routes-preserved-with-clean-public-copy","checked":"2026-08-02","routes":["downloads/forum-posts.json","downloads/forum-posts.md","feed-center.html","share-center.html","launch-room.html","offer-center.html","source-document-vault.html","evidence-vault.html","black-file.html"]}</script></